db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许膝啸韵 其一","author":"马廷鸾","text":"尘满莱衣泪点斑，春风桃李见应难。\n奎文忽到茅檐下，忍作当年义檄看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4247,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"带湖春树先和公手植也感而有赋 其二","author":"马廷鸾","text":"老树今踰七十霜，冰魂玉骨自孤芳。\n大家扶起摧残后，此是吾家召伯棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4248,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"带湖春树先和公手植也感而有赋 其一","author":"马廷鸾","text":"暗香疏影久凄迷，咫尺塘边丈尺泥。\n培植莫教阳德尽，看花踏雪过前堤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4249,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洁堂惠菜饼次韵","author":"马廷鸾","text":"落花寒食漫从容，野摘堪供菜肚翁。\n一笑琅玕青满腹，红绫还忆旧家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4250,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽许秋浦 其二","author":"马廷鸾","text":"苍颜白发王官谷，绿幕黄帘六馆生。\n阅世旧嗟身偃蹇，怀人新有泪纵横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4251,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽许秋浦 其四","author":"马廷鸾","text":"歌骚读尽远游篇，淡日寒空引绋天。\n绕浦黄花秋易老，晚香留付子孙贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4252,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"